# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
venv/
.venv/
.audit_venv/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/

# Env / secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
credentials/
*credentials*

# Real ID card photos - never commit these. assets/front.jpg and
# assets/back.jpg (Hassan's own real card) were previously committed and
# have been scrubbed from history; this guards against re-adding a real
# card image by accident. Only assets/dataset/ (synthetic) and
# assets/*template*/*Egyptian_ID_Card* (blank template) belong in git.
assets/front.jpg
assets/back.jpg

# Hassan's own real card, every scan variant (normal/enhanced/greyscale/
# eco, front and back), plus the expected-values file the accuracy
# regression test reads. This is the benchmark the pipeline is judged
# against, so it has to stay on disk - and it is a real identity
# document, so it must never leave this machine. tests/test_own_benchmark.py
# skips itself when the folder is absent, so the suite still passes for
# anyone who clones the repo without it.
assets/own_benchmark/
detected_front.jpg
detected_back.jpg
detected_*.png
detected_*.jpg

# Generated synthetic training/benchmark data and trained models -
# reproducible via scripts/training/generate_trial_ids.py,
# generate_digit_crops.py, train_digit_classifier.py (fixed seed=42).
# Whole directory, not a list of subfolders - new scratch subfolders
# (e.g. data/_mcp_tmp/, data/synthetic_front_test/) kept slipping past
# an enumerated list and nearly got committed.
data/

# setuptools build scratch dir (build/bdist.*, build/lib/) - regenerated
# by `pip wheel .` / `python -m build`, never hand-edited.
build/

# Node / frontend
node_modules/
dist/
.next/

# Editor / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
.claude/
